#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:7
#: 7fcd1b24ae1e4751b4464248058723bd
msgid "Mission Rewind on Resume"
msgstr "任务恢复时倒回"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:9
#: 0b9c0fb6248d47f0a9cbea0e868c760d
msgid ""
"This page explains what the mission rewind-on-resume feature is and how to "
"use the feature."
msgstr "本页介绍任务恢复时倒回功能的含义及使用方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:11
#: 359ef372c36b416dbe9ce1cc409b62bf
msgid ""
"In certain applications or operating areas it can be common to interrupt a "
"mission, for the purposes of deconfliction, by changing to another mode and "
"manoeuvring the vehicle away from the planned mission path.  When ready to "
"resume the mission, the normal behaviour of the vehicle is to fly/drive "
"directly to the last 'active' waypoint that was loaded in the mission.  This"
" behaviour is illustrated below:"
msgstr ""
"在某些应用场景或操作区域中，可能经常需要通过切换到其他模式并操纵飞行器偏离计划任务路径来中断任务（例如为了避免冲突）。准备恢复任务时，飞行器的正常行为是直飞到任务中最后一个已加载为「活动」状态的航点。此行为如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:20
#: 7353158275344263ab0d32eed0c98b30
msgid ""
"As it can be seen, this leaves a significant portion of the planned mission "
"that is either covered with incorrect track and heading or is not covered at"
" all.  This becomes an issue for data gathering missions such as surveys, "
"resulting in legs of the mission needing to be repeated."
msgstr ""
"如图所示，这会导致计划任务中有相当大一部分要么以错误的轨迹和航向经过，要么根本未被覆盖。这对于测量等数据采集任务来说是个问题，导致部分任务航段需要重新执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:24
#: bdee60e64011446087809c1bdea8a0d5
msgid ""
"The rewind-on-resume feature remedies this behaviour.  A rewind distance is "
"defined by the operator.  When the mission is resumed the vehicle will "
"return to the mission track at the desired distance behind the point that "
"the mission was interrupted.  This gives the vehicle adequate time to "
"achieve the desired track and heading before it achieves the position in "
"which it was originally interrupted.  This behaviour can be seen below:"
msgstr ""
"恢复时倒回功能可以解决此问题。操作员可定义倒回距离。恢复任务时，飞行器将返回到任务被中断位置之前所需距离处的任务轨迹上。这使飞行器有足够时间在到达原中断位置之前恢复到所需的轨迹和航向。此行为如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:36
#: 10303514d946441eb3aa87a437ed9ac4
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:38
#: 6522dff213be47d2beb3940ec215404e
msgid ""
"The rewind-on-resume feature is enabled by setting a "
"DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST mission item.  This can be done in one of two "
"ways:"
msgstr "恢复时倒回功能通过设置 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST 任务项来启用，可通过以下两种方式之一完成："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:42
#: df5a452e52d947f5b6f523a318c64da4
msgid ""
"**1) Ground control station recognises the DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST mission"
" item**"
msgstr "**1) 地面站支持 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST 任务项**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:44
#: 97708f9f59ee4e8aaac60f7209c5faea
msgid ""
"Add a DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST mission item from the point in the mission "
"that you wish to enable the feature."
msgstr "从任务中希望启用该功能的位置开始，添加一个 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST 任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:45
#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:51
#: 074cc444e5fc4fce9e98fd64a20075a0 1ecd11d67b414034bdd3c2dfc767aef3
msgid ""
"Set the first data column to be the distance in meters that you want the "
"mission to be rewound to, on resume."
msgstr "将第一个数据列设置为恢复时倒回的距离（米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:48
#: f6fb6fdee84a4556b0bdceae2b778fdf
msgid ""
"**2) Ground control station does not recognise the DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST"
" mission item**"
msgstr "**2) 地面站不支持 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST 任务项**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:50
#: 57f5154cd26448288a9dc6fadb5ccbdf
msgid ""
"Add an UNKNOWN mission item from the point in the mission that you wish to "
"enable the feature and set the MAVLink ID to 215."
msgstr "从任务中希望启用该功能的位置开始，添加一个 UNKNOWN 任务项，并将 MAVLink ID 设置为 215。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:55
#: 8ff13712bf704fbfbef6475694025d5d
msgid ""
"The MIS_RESTART parameter must be set to zero, to prevent the mission "
"restarting, for this feature to work."
msgstr "MIS_RESTART 参数必须设置为零（防止任务重新开始），此功能才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:57
#: c83b414ff9c546ef963c6a9317fd51cc
msgid ""
"To check that the rewind distance has been correctly set in the mission, "
"monitor the message output in the ground control station.  When the vehicle "
"registers the command the following message will be displayed: \"Resume "
"repeat dist set to <DISTANCE> m\"."
msgstr ""
"要确认倒回距离是否已正确设置在任务中，请监控地面站的消息输出。飞行器注册该命令后，将显示以下消息：「Resume repeat dist set to "
"<DISTANCE> m」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:61
#: ffc967a97a71424e9ed56617bf59817c
msgid ""
"Multiple DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST commands can be set throughout the "
"mission.  This provides the operator the ability to vary the rewind distance"
" or switch the feature on/off throughout the mission, where extreme care and"
" accuracy is required to manoeuvre the vehicle on certain mission legs."
msgstr ""
"可以在整个任务中设置多个 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST "
"命令。这为操作员提供了在任务中变更倒回距离或开关该功能的能力，尤其适用于需要极其谨慎和精确地操控飞行器的特定任务航段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:65
#: 56202e397d864c76a8286c67980d19a1
msgid ""
"This feature can be switched off by setting a DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST "
"mission item with a distance of zero."
msgstr "将 DO_SET_RESUME_REPEAT_DIST 任务项的距离设置为零即可关闭此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:68
#: b70e74b3abbc45c98a1122516aef9c11
msgid ""
"When identifying the resume distance needed, a sensible value to try for "
"most vehicles is twice the minimum turn radius.  The only exception is "
"vehicles that can turn on the spot (multi-rotors and some rovers), in which "
"a sensible distance would be twice the WP_RADIUS."
msgstr ""
"在确定所需的恢复距离时，对大多数飞行器来说，合理的初始值为最小转弯半径的两倍。唯一例外是可以原地转向的飞行器（多旋翼和部分无人车），此时合理的距离为 "
"WP_RADIUS 的两倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:74
#: 10b9dbdf39ef4093b5da7280821a26e3
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:76
#: 910cf20071374043b90e7f165f0e5c12
msgid ""
"Once enabled ArduPilot starts recording the waypoints that are successfully "
"loaded as 'active'.  A history of up to seven waypoints are stored.  Upon a "
"mission rewind-and-resume the mission history will be searched until either:"
msgstr ""
"启用后，ArduPilot 开始记录成功加载为「活动」状态的航点，最多存储 7 "
"个航点的历史记录。执行任务倒回恢复时，系统将搜索任务历史，直到满足以下任一条件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:79
#: a6df9b8b4ac84aab85828e50f2e03881
msgid ""
"A position in the mission track is found that satisfies the rewind distance "
"requirement."
msgstr "在任务轨迹中找到满足倒回距离要求的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:80
#: 73b9ff4b7dae40bf9894803c62fc0978
msgid ""
"The end of stored mission history is found, in which case the resume "
"position will be the last waypoint stored in the history."
msgstr "已到达存储历史记录的末尾，此时恢复位置将为历史记录中存储的最后一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:82
#: 71eff2b7f1c94703b80489ed11d0f81d
msgid ""
"The vehicle will then resume to that location on the mission track and "
"continue the mission as planned."
msgstr "飞行器随后将恢复到任务轨迹上的该位置并按计划继续任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:85
#: 06d58b89e48c44cc917fa153e6270648
msgid ""
"Height is accounted for in the resuming position.  If the vehicle is "
"resuming to a location along the mission track whereby the aircraft is "
"changing altitude, the height of the resuming position will be linearly "
"interpolated between the two neighbouring waypoints."
msgstr "恢复位置会考虑高度因素。如果飞行器恢复到任务轨迹上飞机正在改变高度的某段位置，恢复点的高度将在相邻两个航点之间进行线性插值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:90
#: 0c17a566a1c947928c9cee4efdbf16ad
msgid ""
"To prevent the vehicle from storing an obscure history and resuming to an "
"unexpected location, if the mission is altered by using the set waypoint "
"feature in a ground control station or a script, the history is reset.  This"
" prevents the vehicle from rewinding the mission back past the point that "
"the history was reset."
msgstr ""
"为防止飞行器存储异常历史记录并恢复到意外位置，如果通过地面站或脚本中的「设置航点」功能修改了任务，历史记录将被重置。这可防止飞行器将任务倒回到历史记录被重置点之前的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:95
#: b1aa0e12e7fe4f828403fdb77152b225
msgid ""
"This feature works with DO_JUMP commands and the jump count is not "
"incremented whilst the vehicle is resuming the mission."
msgstr "此功能支持 DO_JUMP 命令，且飞行器在恢复任务过程中不会递增跳转计数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:98
#: 3269737cbc2c413393ca9fde83ab037f
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:100
#: e5a693aa13e844818e570d41a7f3631e
msgid ""
"**1) Short mission legs:** If the mission has closely spaced waypoints and "
"the requested rewind distance is greater than the distance covered by the "
"last six waypoints that have been passed, then the vehicle will resume on "
"the 'oldest' waypoint stored."
msgstr ""
"**1) 短任务航段：** 如果任务中航点间距较密，且请求的倒回距离大于最近 6 个已通过航点所覆盖的距离，则飞行器将恢复到存储的「最早」航点处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:104
#: a8803ddd18b44302914b2fc2d6ca5fe3
msgid ""
"**2) Spline waypoints:**  This feature will work with spline waypoints.  "
"However, the accuracy of the resume distance will be diminished as the "
"distance calculation is based on a straight line between navigation command "
"locations."
msgstr "**2) 样条航点：** 此功能可与样条航点配合使用。但由于距离计算基于导航命令位置之间的直线距离，恢复距离的精度会有所降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mission-rewind.rst:107
#: 5d99ffb3e28f49a8af2446ae0df8829d
msgid ""
"**3) Non-waypoint navigation commands:**  This feature works with non-"
"waypoint navigations commands, for example LOITER_TURNS. However, the "
"distance calculation does not account for the distance of the vehicle track "
"in those commands.  Using the previous example, the distance calculation "
"does not account for the distance flown in the loiter."
msgstr ""
"**3) 非航点导航命令：** 此功能支持非航点导航命令，例如 "
"LOITER_TURNS。但距离计算不计入这些命令中飞行器轨迹的距离。以上例为例，距离计算不计入在 Loiter 中飞行的距离。"
